      "reason": "ORBIO moves into the new inference-credits narrative. PAID and ELON are UsePaid or stock-fee coins already covered by other narratives or without metadata; ERRAND (paid in Orbio credit) and SHILL (hold-to-earn ETH) are separate products.",
